                                                "example_id": "60452630-d971-4863-bf7b-81211170a249",
                                                "sense_id": "e09e9724-b0bc-34bc-addc-05af6c875764",
                                                "text": "They are comfortable trains with decent windows, ideal for observing a line which is one of the last pockets of manually operated crossing gates and semaphore signalling - [...]."
